Frequency Type: Daily · Weekly · Monthly · Quarterly · Multiple times daily (Intraday) · Ad-hoc/Irregular
Frequency Day: Weekly → Mon–Sun (or "Business days"); Monthly → day-of-month 1–31, or "Last business day"/"First business day"; Daily → blank or "Every day"
Expected start/end time: a window (e.g. "09:00–09:30"), from the earliest/latest observed arrival per cycle
Excluding Day: Saturday, Sunday, Public Holidays — or blank if the pattern runs every day with no gaps